WEBVTT

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:40.390
<i>Episode 7</i>

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:53.830
How annoying. Why isn't 
anything going smoothly today?

00:01:53.830 --> 00:01:54.390
Mochi!

00:01:57.930 --> 00:02:00.700
Why do I suddenly feel so weak?

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:05.730
Who set up an Anti-Spirit Barrier here?

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:13.480
<i><i>Father?</i></i>

00:02:18.890 --> 00:02:19.640
<i><i>Right.</i></i>

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:23.510
<i><i>I have to talk to Father and 
ask him where Auntie Xue is.</i></i>

00:02:36.850 --> 00:02:38.510
Mistress, are you okay?

00:02:39.270 --> 00:02:40.640
Are you blind?

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:44.450
Sorry, my bad.

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:47.640
But since we both fell down, 
let's call it quits, okay?

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:49.600
How presumptuous!

00:02:49.990 --> 00:02:53.140
How dare a lowly maid excuse herself 
after running into her mistress!

00:02:54.970 --> 00:02:58.220
Mistress, she looks like 
the maid from the feast.

00:02:59.710 --> 00:03:00.720
That one?

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:01.280
Yes.

00:03:12.390 --> 00:03:16.530
Lowly maid, not only did you seduce 
Lord Beitang, you have also caused me pain.

00:03:16.990 --> 00:03:18.020
On your knees!

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:20.870
You heard the mistress! Kowtow to her!

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:27.270
I go away for a few days,
and your manners desert you?

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:31.020
Don't you know how to greet your elder sister?

00:03:31.930 --> 00:03:34.520
What nonsense are you spouting?

00:03:35.350 --> 00:03:37.520
Stupid girl. Look closer.

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:43.020
Even if you don't recognize your elder sister,
you should know the face of Princess Ye.

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:47.150
Princess Ye?

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:49.020
Then, that means...

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:53.020
So you finally caught on. Good.
I'm going to go talk to Father now.

00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:01.020
What an insolent slave.

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:02.520
What?

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:04.020
Guards!

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:06.570
Bring this maid back with me.

00:04:06.570 --> 00:04:08.270
I will punish her myself!

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:15.770
You have a lot of nerve for a lowly maid.

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:19.020
Hurry up and bow to your mistress.

00:04:20.020 --> 00:04:21.020
Let me go!

00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:25.200
You think you are deserving of a bow from me?

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:27.390
Besides, I'm still your elder sister.

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:31.320
My elder sister?

00:04:31.970 --> 00:04:33.520
You think you can be?

00:04:34.030 --> 00:04:36.250
You are a bastard child
raised in the mountains.

00:04:37.470 --> 00:04:40.000
If I had not afforded you this opportunity,

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:42.640
you would never have come
to the capital in your lifetime.

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:47.140
Since she does not wish to bow, hold her
 down and make her kneel before me.

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:51.790
On top of being your elder 
sister, I'm also Princess Ye!

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:55.140
You're the one who should kowtow 
before me, don't you think?

00:04:55.720 --> 00:04:58.140
Unless you choose to defy your superior?

00:05:00.350 --> 00:05:05.140
You may well be Princess Ye, but you
flirted with Lord Beitang during the feast.

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:08.110
Courting the eye of
another man is infidelity.

00:05:08.810 --> 00:05:14.750
Let me see... Can you still be a "princess"
if Prince Ye finds out about that?

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:17.580
Think about it, stupid.

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:19.950
Even if I did cheat on Prince Ye,

00:05:19.950 --> 00:05:22.940
people would think it was you: Qian Yunshang.

00:05:26.140 --> 00:05:29.140
How can such a shameless woman as you exist?

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:33.300
What raving and ranting is this I hear?

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:39.770
Who dares slander the 
innocence of my Yunshang?

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:43.270
Father? Mother?

00:05:46.680 --> 00:05:47.270
Father?

00:05:48.060 --> 00:05:54.470
Mother! You and Father arrived just in time!
My reputation was about to be ruined!

00:05:54.890 --> 00:05:57.270
Mother! She was bullying me.

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:58.780
Do not be scared, child. Your mother is here.

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:02.270
Oh, come on, she's putting on an act again.

00:06:04.850 --> 00:06:06.770
Greetings, Father.

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:10.270
Is that really you?

00:06:10.270 --> 00:06:12.970
Yunxi, why have you returned?

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:14.900
And dressed like that...

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:17.270
I came to find Que'er and Auntie Xue.

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:22.580
When did you come back?

00:06:23.180 --> 00:06:24.900
Does anyone know you are here?

00:06:25.850 --> 00:06:29.180
Do not tell me Ye Youming is here as well?

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:33.680
I came back in secret to visit Auntie Xue.
No one else knows I'm here.

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:37.920
Do you have any idea of your position?
What mistress comes to visit her slaves?

00:06:38.640 --> 00:06:41.180
Look at how you are behaving. How improper!

00:06:42.640 --> 00:06:43.680
Father!

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:47.680
She used her title of Princess Ye to bully me.
She wishes to snatch Lord Beitang from me!

00:06:48.390 --> 00:06:50.950
What did I tell you before you got married?

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:54.840
Do you not realize that such an unreasonable
 act would harm our whole house?

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:57.250
You should go back immediately.

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:59.890
I'll do just that, but on two conditions.

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:01.680
First, I take Que'er with me.

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:06.520
Second, you must promise to find Auntie Xue,
bring her back, and treat her illness!

00:07:07.350 --> 00:07:10.000
Why was Auntie Xue kicked out 
of the House of Grand Councilor?

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:14.140
Why were her precious blood-jade earrings
taken and given to the Crown Prince as a gift?

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:19.410
Dear wife, is this true?

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:23.660
Husband, Xue was gravely ill
with an infectious disease.

00:07:23.660 --> 00:07:25.350
I had no choice but to send her away.

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:30.350
Yes, Father, Que'er stayed with me.
Who dares to bully her?

00:07:31.070 --> 00:07:31.850
Baloney!

00:07:32.350 --> 00:07:35.350
You made Auntie Xue do heavy work on
a daily basis. How could she <i>not</i> get sick?

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:40.950
Yunxi, how can you sling mud at me?

00:07:40.950 --> 00:07:43.540
Is it wrong to ask the maids to work?

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:47.250
Besides, Yunshang let you be Princess Ye,

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:49.370
meaning you could leave
 Spirit Cloud Mountain.

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:50.300
"Let"?

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:54.600
At the risk of deceiving the emperor, 
you "let" me marry Prince Ye in my sister's stead.

00:07:55.390 --> 00:07:59.080
Was it really for my sake? The girl 
called a "jinx" from an early age?

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:01.600
Then, "let" me return the title
of "princess" to my sister.

00:08:02.180 --> 00:08:03.100
Ridiculous!

00:08:03.680 --> 00:08:07.050
This is an outrage. You think 
you can do whatever you want?

00:08:08.970 --> 00:08:11.580
Like mother, like daughter.

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:15.650
In the past, your mother 
envied and hated my mother,

00:08:15.650 --> 00:08:18.290
so she used witchcraft to hurt
people. How cruel and evil.

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:21.900
Oh, but you are not like your 
mother. You are even worse.

00:08:21.900 --> 00:08:23.600
You want to hurt your whole house.

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:27.260
You are your mother's daughter.

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:37.690
Your Highness.

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:40.680
We have enough soldiers to surround 
the House of Grand Councilor.

00:08:41.720 --> 00:08:42.430
No need.

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:45.180
We are simply collecting my
 princess. Why surround them?

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:46.680
But...

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:50.200
The princess is visiting her family.
 It is nothing to worry about.

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:52.370
Even evil tigers do not eat their young.

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:56.700
Qian Aotian is evil, but even he 
would not harm his own daughter.

00:08:57.430 --> 00:08:58.390
Let us go.

00:08:57.940 --> 00:08:58.390
Yes, sir.

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:18.180
Insult me all you like, but I won't
 let you badmouth my mother!

00:09:18.900 --> 00:09:20.180
Shang'er!

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:23.290
You brutish bastard child!

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:24.680
How can you be so violent?

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:28.000
Auntie, since you're my elder,

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:30.800
I will let it slide this time,
 but watch what you say.

00:09:32.520 --> 00:09:33.630
Silence!

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:37.380
Unfilial daughter! Apologize to your sister!

00:09:40.770 --> 00:09:44.180
Who framed my mother all those
years ago? You know it in your heart.

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:46.350
Why distort the truth like that?

00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:49.180
My mother never hurt anyone.

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:53.120
That sinner hurt others and herself.
Conclusive evidence proved as such.

00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:54.680
Do not hurl wild accusations here!

00:09:55.450 --> 00:10:00.290
Guards, take her away
and flog her thirty times!

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:06.340
Halt!

00:10:06.740 --> 00:10:09.680
The Grand Councilor is hosting important 
guests. No uninvited visitors may enter.

00:10:10.270 --> 00:10:12.680
This is Prince Ye. How dare 
you deny entry to His Highness!

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:17.660
Forgive me, Your Highness. Allow me
 to announce you to the Grand Councilor.

00:10:17.660 --> 00:10:20.560
I have come for my princess. 
The Grand Councilor need not be disturbed.

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:23.390
Your Highness!

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:24.720
Your Highness!

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:30.560
Admit your wrongdoing.

00:10:31.850 --> 00:10:34.290
I've done nothing wrong. 
Why are you accusing me?

00:10:34.290 --> 00:10:35.720
Why did you accuse my mother?

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:37.100
You—

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:40.970
I see. You do not wish to redeem yourself.

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:42.160
Flog her.

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:44.020
Flog her until she apologizes.

00:10:46.970 --> 00:10:48.220
Flog her with all your might.

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:53.220
You can't hit me. I'm Princess Ye.

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:55.720
And what of it?

00:10:56.930 --> 00:11:00.720
Even if Prince Ye were present, 
a father can still discipline his daughter.

00:11:16.680 --> 00:11:19.220
Your Highness, please wait!

00:11:20.080 --> 00:11:20.720
Do it.

00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:28.240
Stop.

00:11:31.490 --> 00:11:32.220
And who is this?

00:11:36.310 --> 00:11:39.790
Master, Prince Ye barged in 
before I could announce his coming.

00:11:39.790 --> 00:11:42.720
I did not dare stop him. Please forgive me.

00:11:44.060 --> 00:11:46.250
Prince Ye-diot? What's he doing here?

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:50.720
So Prince Ye does me the honor. Forgive me 
for not welcoming Your Highness at the gate.

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:53.720
It is of no consequence, Grand Councilor.

00:11:55.180 --> 00:11:58.250
Why did Your Highness not allow my 
guards to announce your presence?

00:11:58.250 --> 00:12:02.350
What urgent matter sees you
visit us without an entourage?

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:06.350
I have come to take my princess back with me.

00:12:06.610 --> 00:12:10.310
I have been indisposed lately, 
and as a result, neglected my princess.

00:12:10.720 --> 00:12:13.350
It would seem she came back here alone.

00:12:14.270 --> 00:12:15.300
<i><i>Take me back?</i></i>

00:12:15.700 --> 00:12:16.850
<i><i>He noticed I was gone?</i></i>

00:12:17.810 --> 00:12:18.530
<i><i>Damn.</i></i>

00:12:22.810 --> 00:12:25.960
He's looking at me. Does he recognize me?

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:29.460
I found Yunshang had come 
home without my permission.

00:12:29.460 --> 00:12:32.660
After asking the reason, I discovered 
she had not informed Your Highness,

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:34.350
and had come here of her own accord.

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:39.040
I wonder what crime my princess
has committed to receive a flogging.

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:42.040
<i><i>I have long heard tales of 
Prince Ye's impressive appearance, </i></i>

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:44.700
<i><i>despite his demeanor being cold as ice.</i></i>

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:47.970
<i><i>But if I had a husband like him,
it would be worth giving up my life here.</i></i>

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:50.950
<i><i>Rats, I gave that wretch a gift.</i></i>

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:55.950
I was afraid Your Highness' reputation 
would be besmirched by her recklessness.

00:12:55.950 --> 00:12:58.320
Her actions angered me greatly.

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:02.640
Shang'er, hurry up and
apologize to His Highness.

00:13:04.140 --> 00:13:09.910
<i><i>How he twists! With a few words, accusations of
 misdeeds become a consideration of others.</i></i>

00:13:10.490 --> 00:13:12.910
I... I left the palace without your say-so.

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:14.870
I'm sorry, Your Highness.

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:17.910
Shang'er, how can you speak
to His Highness so rudely?

00:13:17.910 --> 00:13:20.720
Have you forgotten how 
to behave in front of men?

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:26.410
<i><i>Damn him. The prince didn't object.
Why is he sticking his big nose in?</i></i>

00:13:27.850 --> 00:13:31.540
Your wife greets you, Your Highness.
Please forgive your wife's behavior.

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:32.850
Princess, do not stand on ceremony.

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:36.450
Your Highness, please allow 
me to escort you to the lobby.

00:13:36.450 --> 00:13:39.290
Let me prepare you some 
exquisite tea and snacks.

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:42.030
There is no need. I have matters to attend to.

00:13:42.030 --> 00:13:45.970
Since I have retrieved my princess,
 I will take my leave.

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:51.130
<i><i>So we're leaving already? </i></i>

00:13:51.570 --> 00:13:54.100
<i><i>Oh, wait, I can use this opportunity.</i></i>

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:58.790
Since Your Highness has matters to attend to,
I will not keep Your Highness a moment longer.

00:13:58.790 --> 00:13:59.720
A moment.

00:14:00.180 --> 00:14:05.120
I am ever so lonely in the palace.
That is why I sneaked back home.

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:08.870
If the maid I grew up with
 could accompany me back,

00:14:08.870 --> 00:14:11.580
I would not run off again.

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:14.060
<i><i>This girl is shrewd indeed.</i></i>

00:14:14.970 --> 00:14:19.060
<i><i>I'd be stupid not to take advantage
 of such a golden opportunity.</i></i>

00:14:19.930 --> 00:14:24.080
Oh, and about Auntie Xue... please 
find her in the next ten days, Father.

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:25.200
That won't be a problem, right?

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:26.640
Ten days?

00:14:27.020 --> 00:14:28.060
That is...

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:31.120
If I don't get to see Auntie Xue,
I will miss her so much,

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:33.560
and I might go saying something stupid.

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:35.980
<i><i>How dare she threaten me! </i></i>

00:14:36.410 --> 00:14:39.070
<i><i>I should not have let her marry Prince Ye.</i></i>

00:14:40.680 --> 00:14:43.310
I shall endeavor to do what I can.

00:14:43.310 --> 00:14:45.830
And please follow the rules 
and rituals, Your Highness.

00:14:45.830 --> 00:14:51.060
Stay at the Ye Princely Palace, and do not
do anything unbefitting of your status.

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:55.030
<i><i>I loathe you! Do you think you 
deserve to be Princess Ye?</i></i>

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:57.950
<i><i>I gave you that position as a charity to you.</i></i>

00:14:57.950 --> 00:15:00.720
<i><i>Qian Yunxi, just you wait!</i></i>

00:15:07.140 --> 00:15:09.310
Farewell, Your Highness.

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:14.750
By the way, I was told you held a feast today,
and a special guest was in attendance.

00:15:15.650 --> 00:15:19.750
An old friend of mine who had 
made a rare trip to the capital.

00:15:20.870 --> 00:15:22.770
Someone from the west?

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:26.750
He... is fond of traveling.

00:15:31.850 --> 00:15:32.860
<i><i>So...</i></i>

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:35.270
<i><i>You are Princess Ye, hm?</i></i>

00:15:43.220 --> 00:15:46.720
<i><i>Great! It seems the title of 
"Princess Ye" finally came in useful.</i></i>

00:15:47.600 --> 00:15:51.440
<i><i>I can mess around with Que'er again.
I'm happy just thinking about it!</i></i>

00:16:05.640 --> 00:16:06.830
Just so we're clear.

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:08.550
I don't love you in the slightest.

00:16:09.770 --> 00:16:13.460
But... thank you for today.
